{"id":"dfb3a1b8ce624085","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-simple-closed-curve.md","title":"Simple Closed Curve","display":"df-simple-closed-curve — Simple Closed Curve","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-simple-closed-curve","aliases":["58-df-simple-closed-curve","Simple Closed Curve"],"display":"df-simple-closed-curve — Simple Closed Curve","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-simple-closed-curve"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-simple-closed-curve</span><span>Simple Closed Curve</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-simple-closed-curve — Simple Closed Curve"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma,M,\\tau_M\\in V\">\\(\\gamma,M,\\tau_M\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{S^1}\">\\(\\tau_{S^1}\\)</span> (standard circle topology)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\)</span> (five-argument homeomorphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SimpleClosedCurve}_S\\subseteq V^3\\cup V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{SimpleClosedCurve}_S\\subseteq V^3\\cup V^2\\)</span> (precise predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}closed\\text{-}curve} \\vdash \\operatorname{SimpleClosedCurve}_S(\\gamma,M,\\tau_M)\\leftrightarrow\\gamma[S^1]\\subseteq M\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\bigl(\\gamma,S^1,\\tau_{S^1},\\gamma[S^1],\\{U\\cap\\gamma[S^1]:U\\in\\tau_M\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}closed\\text{-}curve} \\vdash \\operatorname{SimpleClosedCurve}_S(\\gamma,M,\\tau_M)\\leftrightarrow\\gamma[S^1]\\subseteq M\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\bigl(\\gamma,S^1,\\tau_{S^1},\\gamma[S^1],\\{U\\cap\\gamma[S^1]:U\\in\\tau_M\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}closed\\text{-}curve\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\operatorname{SimpleClosedCurve}_S(\\gamma,M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau_M\\in V\\;\\operatorname{SimpleClosedCurve}_S(\\gamma,M,\\tau_M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}closed\\text{-}curve\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\operatorname{SimpleClosedCurve}_S(\\gamma,M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau_M\\in V\\;\\operatorname{SimpleClosedCurve}_S(\\gamma,M,\\tau_M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The precise predicate carries the ambient topology and uses the induced topology on the image, matching the upstream five-argument homeomorphism signature.</li>\n<li>Simple closed: injective image of circle; Jordan curve theorem.</li>\n<li>Jordan separation and the isoperimetric inequality are consequences for special ambient spaces, not defining clauses.</li>\n<li>Jordan: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^2 \\setminus C\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^2 \\setminus C\\)</span> has two components; inside/outside well-defined</li>\n<li>In the plane, the Jordan--Schoenflies theorem gives a bounded disk; an embedded circle in an arbitrary manifold need not bound a disk.</li>\n<li>Planar rectifiable simple closed curves satisfy the isoperimetric inequality, with equality for circles.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>do Carmo, Riemannian Geometry</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Homeo}_S$ (five-argument homeomorphism predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\gamma,M,\\tau_M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{S^1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SimpleClosedCurve}_S\\subseteq V^3\\cup V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}closed\\text{-}curve} \\vdash \\operatorname{SimpleClosedCurve}_S(\\gamma,M,\\tau_M)\\leftrightarrow\\gamma[S^1]\\subseteq M\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\bigl(\\gamma,S^1,\\tau_{S^1},\\gamma[S^1],\\{U\\cap\\gamma[S^1]:U\\in\\tau_M\\}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}closed\\text{-}curve\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\operatorname{SimpleClosedCurve}_S(\\gamma,M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau_M\\in V\\;\\operatorname{SimpleClosedCurve}_S(\\gamma,M,\\tau_M)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}^2 \\setminus C","display":false}],"bytes":1938,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-simple-closed-curve.md|58-df-simple-closed-curve]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["c4b4a825f2ea608d","36d7463d215be751"]}